          "value": "They said we were mad. They said we were spouting nonsense. Spreading fear, hysteria, paranoia! But the squirrels, you see, the squirrels are planning something. Don’t believe us? Look at these cards! You think these are soft, fuzzy, friendly creatures? Sure, they might look cute, but it’s all an act to get us to let our guards down. (Between you and us, we think that illustrators Puffygator, Joy Ang, Carl Critchlow, Ivan Shavrin, Rudy Siswanto, and Ron Spencer might be on their side. Look how awesome this art is; they’re clearly double agents!)\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Chatter of the Squirrel\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Krosan Beast\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Squirrel Mob\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Squirrel Wrangler\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Alt-Art Swarmyard\r\n<br>• 1x Foil Squirrel Token"
